  "name": "Demo connector",
  "version": "2",
  "description": "Plays a made-up drive for a demo car: it parks, gets in, drives (the position moves, the level changes), stops and gets out, sometimes with a fault - one report every 5 seconds through the normal interface, like a real connected car. Switch it off (Start / Stop) and the car stands still.",
